    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1600-a1">

                <pb facs="1011" n="895" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg895"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Constitutionalist Army, <lb/> Division of
                                the North</hi></placeName>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Col. Miguel Hernandez, in a telephone message to-day tells me: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>General Francisco Villa orders me: Inform the ranches “Encarnacion,”
                            “Tayanua,” “Salto,” “Santiago “and any others along that route which are
                            confiscated, that from this moment they are absolutely prohibited from
                            taking away corn, stock, or anything, even though they may have an order
                            of the Department of Agriculture, until a new order has been given.
                            Please convey as quickly as possible this order to the managers of these
                            properties. This I communicate to you for your information and due
                            performance.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Villanueva</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 13, 1914</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/> First Captain, Chief of Arms, <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. S. Garay</hi></signed>. <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">German Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-07"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">November 7, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
